      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "0806.2366_p1_b15",
      "text": "Suppose that f(x) \u2208C\u221e(0, +\u221e). We shall calculate [f(ln x)](n) by x. De-\nnoting ln x = t we have\n",
      "bbox": [
